<p>Hello,</p>

<p>Your {{brand_name}} account was just signed in to from a location we have not seen before.</p>

<p>Sign-in details:</p>
<ul>
  {% if city or country %}<li>Location: {{city}}{% if city and country %}, {% endif %}{{country}}</li>{% endif %}
  {% if browser_name %}<li>Browser: {{browser_name}}{% if platform_name %} on {{platform_name}}{% endif %}</li>{% endif %}
  {% if ip %}<li>IP address: {{ip}}</li>{% endif %}
</ul>

<p>If this was you, no action is needed.</p>

<p>If this was not you, <a href="{{reset_password_url}}">reset your password</a> and sign out of your other devices from Profile Settings.</p>
